<title>USA: FSA qualifies 10 issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies 10 issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSA said it qualified for insurance 10 issues slated for competitive sale on Monday.</p>
<p>--Winterset Community SD, Iowa, $1.2 million GO capital loan.</p>
<p>--Rockford, Ill., $13.2 million of GO refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Ireland Drain District, Mich., $1.6 million refunding.</p>
<p>--Alexandria ISD #206, Minn., $13.8 million of GO refunding bonds.</p>
<p>--Novi, Mich., $11.2 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Hills-Beaver ISD #671, Minn., $1.9 million GO school building bonds.</p>
<p>--East Penn SD, Pa., $12.5 million GO bonds.</p>
<p>--East Stroudsburg SD, Pa., $9.9 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Wittenberg SD, Wis., $2.2 million of GO school improvement bonds.</p>
<p>--Great Falls HSD, Mont., $5 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
